{"server":"cn","storyId":"act24side_level_act24side_02_end","groupId":"act24side","stageId":"act24side_02","title":"坚硬磐石","storyCode":"CF-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act24side/level_act24side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"aafdbeb89a1c94691cdd4095560c9104a34cc926bb865afd466dbf01a80b88a9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"来了——右侧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心上方！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"好险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"感染生物也太多了！它们怎么会出现在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年你还是没有改掉问无意义问题的习惯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绝对不能让这些害虫继续前进了，这么多感染生物进入村庄，后果不堪设想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你的右边！又来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——这刀！可恶，砍了太多次，越来越钝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"阻挡......俺记得包里还有些上次任务申请的源石炸药，是遥控触发的，威力足够炸开井盖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"得想个方法可以不让炸弹连俺们一起炸飞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个通风井......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通风井打通了洞穴的内壁，炸弹可以破开封闭的井罩，给我们打开逃脱的通道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我们出来后再迅速引爆下方的炸弹，破坏这一段的洞穴来阻挡它们的去路......这是可行的方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但上方爆炸后也会让这一段洞穴的结构变得脆弱，逃脱的时间非常有限，必须抓紧时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布置炸弹的时候，必须有一个人挡住感染生物，你可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"不用问，你去布置，俺能撑住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺在这里！你们一个都！别想过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马上......好！布置完成了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上方炸弹预备引爆！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打开了......确认在预期范围内。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你先上去！俺把它们挡在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，那样太危险了，你很有可能会被埋在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"你听俺的，不然一定会有漏网之鳞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，那你听好我的指令。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我上来了！黑角，迅速撤离！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺来了，嘿——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"爬梯断了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会？*东国粗口*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"夜刀，你冷静，俺还没事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"冷静，冷静，我想想......有了，还有个办法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直接引爆炸弹，你用盾牌去挡住冲击波，借助冲力上来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一定会抓住你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"做好准备！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g3_redleafforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好——我抓住你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上——来——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺的身体——太好了！是完整的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑角......你确实应该少吃一点了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"俺回去后找芙蓉请教健康餐的做法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经来到森林里了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小工匠，来这里！长角的两个人逃出来了喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃出来了喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你们可以从任何地方突然冒出来啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那些肉块是被人放在那里的，有人想引诱洞穴深处的东西出来，几乎可以肯定是要针对我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们逃出来了，那个人的计划应该没有奏效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是那个给俺们提供位置的村民干的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是不是他，至少洞穴暂时封锁住了，他现在很难有进一步的手段对付我们，我不相信他的目的是毁了自己的村子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果矿石病与火龙都和洞穴有关，那么最直接解决问题的途径是......找到洞穴的尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据洞穴的走向，它的尽头一定在这山脉中的某一处，但具体位置会很难确定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"去找火龙怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"洞穴里的情况......说明火龙至少在那里出现过，也许火龙就在洞穴的尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，很有可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考虑到返回村庄会难以脱身，看来我们只有一个选择了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前往森林深处寻找火龙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚经历了惊险的危机，即将要踏上追逐火龙的旅程，猫生可真是停不下来啊喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以！填饱肚子很重要喵！来享用艾露猫的独门料理喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是之前剩下的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么都不懂嘛，美味是不会褪色的喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑角","speakerId":"char_500_noirc","isRemote":false,"text":"算了......俺要吃肉，给俺来一块。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"学者猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_752_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生态调查喵！前进！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工匠猫","speakerId":"avg_npc_751_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新素材！前进喵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咀嚼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜刀","speakerId":"avg_502_Yato_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火龙......等着吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g10_easternhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利藤，你擅自将他们引向了洞穴，给我一个理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很简单，他们不是和你说要对付那怪物吗？我就给他们创造条件了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明白让外人知道我们的秘密会有什么后果吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，当然，就连你许久才回来一次的侄女，知道了以后都闹得鸡犬不宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是让罗德岛这种熟悉源石的企业知道了，后果更是不堪设想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能承担这种后果吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们会死在里面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村长，你好好想想，我已经布好了诱饵，你我过去都是猎人，明白野兽最能被血腥味诱惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在见到我们的秘密之前，他们就会撞见那怪物，然后砰——战斗一触即发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是他们没有本事，自然会被怪物处理掉，也不需要我们关心后果了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是他们真有本事能处理掉怪物，那不是也正中下怀吗？我们的危险成功排除了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在看到他们进去以后，我派的人等了一段时间才跟进去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们和怪物战斗后一定会遍体鳞伤吧？那个时候我们想要处置他们......轻而易举。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论怎样，都是对我们有利不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你考虑得倒是清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，无论如何......都比你选择封锁洞口，一意隐瞒要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，别那么严肃嘛，我知道您当然也有这样的考虑，我只是帮您提前做好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟明那家伙不在了以后，我就是您最好的帮手了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_758_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村长，大事不好了！后山的洞穴爆炸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌张的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_758_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洞穴......被石头堵住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了，带一些人去清理残渣，重新疏通洞穴吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利藤，这也是你安排的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？这倒是在意料之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过既然洞穴被炸塌了，他们想必也难活，大概是与怪物同归于尽了，小问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次的事件......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是会根据之后对村子的利弊，来决定是否追究你擅自行动的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我会派人去搜寻，确保他们闭嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"利藤裕","speakerId":"avg_npc_757_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样就很好嘛，那我就先回去了，还有不少账单等着我去查验呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不送。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泷居应","speakerId":"avg_npc_753_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿明，你说得对......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"36_g3_redleafforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叶子又落下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来已经是秋天了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"柏生义冈","speakerId":"avg_npc_755_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明，我们走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_500_noirc","aliases":["黑角"]}]}
